"The Heirs are Nathan, Khachi, Sarah, Aarl and Stella, all of Gemore."
"Later, the Heirs swear an oath to defend Gemore against the dangers of Davrar."
"Later, they swear an Oath on the Gemore Seal and on their classes to end the Endings."
"Khachi's oath blessing anchors the Heirs' will to Davrar until their vow is kept."
"Later, the Heirs clear the tomb of Sklias outside Gemore."
"Later, the Heirs beat Badud, free Giantsrest and help rebuild it."
"Later, the Heirs train in Keihona and sail for Esebus to kill Badud's grid, their first deed."
"Their second deed clears the Helmaris blight; their third wins a polite war for the Ashen Accord."
"Those deeds win them the right to call a Conclave, which draws record attendance."
"At that Conclave the Heirs kill nine Questors in duels."
"Their fallback is to return to Gemore and shield it from the Endings."
"Years later, the Heirs displace Brox from Gemore, and some Questor allies cool toward them."
